{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026qRUFp05mzG1792985347.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>《愛·回家之三代同糖》一眾演員日前快閃現身銅鑼灣鬧市，與現場觀眾熱烈互動，親自推介劇集的最新劇情發展。</p><p></p><p>在活動中，萬眾期待終於「回家」的樊亦敏與歐瑞偉亦「驚喜駕到」現身鬧市街頭。二人更率先預告於劇中的造型將會非常百變又過癮，配合玩味十足的劇情，令一眾粉絲直呼期待！</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"42ac1913-7750-4bce-ae0e-29127f41289e.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026VdfMKXlUkB1792985346.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"c2820f1c-642a-46f8-9f32-5922d6b42227.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026cjUJapu8Az1792985347.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>此外，眾演員在現場分組挑戰甜蜜互動遊戲，並大擺甜蜜搞怪的「Pose」，吸引了大批沿途路人與粉絲圍觀支持，場面十分熱鬧。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:24.150622+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T03:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T07:38:24.190806+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:41.424778+00:00","content_hash":"40bc3c17748d0c9721258a7a8905e95c23ca7a41540fcf3a554453daa2fa45f3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}